[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2561637287","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100798#issuecomment-2561637287","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100798","id":2561637287,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Yr3un","user":{"login":"tetrapod00","id":145553014,"node_id":"U_kgDOCKz2dg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/145553014?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00","html_url":"https://github.com/tetrapod00","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-25T05:56:07Z","updated_at":"2024-12-25T05:56:07Z","body":"Maybe duplicate of https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/95113","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2561637287/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2561955843","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100798#issuecomment-2561955843","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100798","id":2561955843,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6YtFgD","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-25T17:15:05Z","updated_at":"2024-12-25T17:15:05Z","body":"Duplicate of:\n\n* #80586\n* #83876\n* #89959\n* #93063\n* #93084\n\nSee:\n\n* [Wikipedia - Covariance and contravariance (computer science)](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Covariance_and_contravariance_(computer_science))\n* [GDScript reference - Typed arrays](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.html#typed-arrays)\n* godotengine/godot-proposals#7364\n\n![](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/assets/47700418/f75cea69-5544-40df-b111-f798cdb32901)\n\nThis is not a bug. Arrays are passed by reference; they do not copy the entire content. Otherwise you would get:\n\n```gdscript\nvar a: Array[Node2D]\nvar b: Array[Node]\nb = a # Now `b` refers to the same array as `a`.\nb.append(Label.new()) # Valid, `Label` is a subtype of `Node`.\nprint(a[0]) # Invalid, `Label` is **not** a subtype of `Node2D`.\n```\n\nProbably the only way this would work is if the GDScript supported [`read`/`write` qualifiers](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/discussions/7364#discussioncomment-6576975). But it's too difficult.\n\nThanks for the contribution nonetheless!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2561955843/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]